-  prompt: |
-    CONTEXT:
-    Exp6813 reported a positive selective-priority result over 576 authentic rows. Exp6814 tried
-    to audit parsing, arbitration, aggregation, adversarial attacks, and adoption in one task. It
-    timed out twice and produced no terminal artifact. This task is the bounded row-replay shard.
-    It tests producer arithmetic and row identity only. It invokes no LLM.
-
-    Work at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.
-
-    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-    - {project_root}/CLAUDE.md and {project_root}/CODEX.md
-    - {project_root}/research-program.md and {project_root}/_bmad/prd.md, FR12
-    - {project_root}/research-references.md, V596 Planner Refresh
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6811_operational_obligation_automaton_v3.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6812_sota_operational_handoff_corpus_v2.json
-    - {project_root}/results/experiment_6813_selective_priority_arbiter_ab.json
-    - {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/constraint-verification/spec.md
-    - {project_root}/scripts/verdict_row_consistency_lint.py
-
-    TASK:
-    Reparse Exp6812 raw bytes with a fresh parser. Independently rebuild the lexicographic arbiter
-    and recompute every Exp6813 row, per-arm metric, paired delta, interval, and headline. Do not
-    import the Exp6813 producer, reducer, or verdict code. Do not run the authority attack suite.
-
-    CONCRETE STEPS:
-    0. PRECONDITIONS: require readable raw-byte manifests, 576 complete source rows, source hashes,
-       the frozen arm manifest, and selective_arbiter_ab_completed=true. On failure write
-       complete_blocked_selective_arbiter_cold_row_replay with gate_check_summary and stop.
-    1. Write focused tests first for independent parsing, obligation ordering, safe-action identity,
-       matched budgets, paired joins, confidence intervals, row deletion, and aggregate recompute.
-    2. Implement fresh parser, arbiter, and reducer modules that do not import Exp6813. Hash their
-       source files and record their module identities.
-    3. Reparse every raw proposal. Recompute hard violations, progress, retry cost, false
-       interventions, safe-action identity, legal support, and certificate completeness per row.
-    4. Recompute every producer headline from cold rows. Report numerical differences with a frozen
-       tolerance. Preserve positive, null, harmful, and contradictory outcomes.
-    5. Emit one row per original unit plus explicit deletion and duplicate-row audit cases. Set
-       cold_replay_shard_complete from row coverage, hash identity, independent code, and complete
-       recomputation, independent of agreement with the producer.
-    6. Run focused tests, ruff, OpenSpec coverage, adversarial verification, artifact convention
-       audit, verdict-row consistency lint, and root-clutter checks.
-    7. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS AND PRINCIPLES: field_principles (one principle per field);
-       inference_substrate (fresh-process deterministic CPU replay, no LLM); duration_s (measured
-       wall time); random_seed (fixed interval and audit seeds); reproducibility_checksum (bind
-       inputs, code, rows, commands, and output); source_artifact_hashes (Exp6811-Exp6813 identity);
-       independent_parser_id (no producer import); independent_arbiter_id (fresh authority code);
-       independent_reducer_id (fresh aggregation code); rows (every source unit and audit case);
-       row_coverage (expected and observed identities); aggregate_recomputation (all producer
-       headlines); headline_differences (producer versus cold); budget_recomputation (arm parity);
-       safe_action_identity_recomputation (already-valid proposals); hard_violation_recomputation
-       (exact); false_intervention_recomputation (exact); source_verdict_supported (closed row
-       decision); cold_replay_shard_complete (exact field consumed by Exp6826);
-       gate_check_summary (failed check, expected value, and observed value for any blocked
-       verdict); verifier_is_oracle (false, the audit checks a producer claim); verdict_class
-       (closed enum: positive | circular_positive | null | blocked | disqualified | partial);
-       honest_verdict (terminal and cold-row-supported).
-
-    Run command: cd {project_root} && .venv/bin/python scripts/experiments/experiment_6824_selective_arbiter_cold_row_replay.py --date {date}
-    Do NOT push. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py.
