-       fields); feature_denylist (model labels, outcomes, and future fields); rows (every source and
-       mutation unit); priority_attack_results (fail-closed results); safe_action_attack_results
-       (byte identity); certificate_attack_results (local conflict truth); prohibited_feature_
-       findings (influence tests); row_integrity_attacks (deletion, duplicate, and reorder);
-       hard_authority_supported (separate decision); authority_attack_shard_complete (exact field
-       consumed by Exp6826); gate_check_summary (failed check, expected value, and observed value
-       for any blocked verdict); verifier_is_oracle (false, the audit checks authority behavior);
-       verdict_class (closed enum: positive | circular_positive | null | blocked | disqualified |
-       partial); honest_verdict (terminal and row-supported).
-
-    Run command: cd {project_root} && .venv/bin/python scripts/experiments/experiment_6825_selective_arbiter_authority_attacks.py --date {date}
-    Do NOT push. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py.
